Generic single-database configuration.

  
for migrations:
run command, and also update the table class with length in string type:
 alembic revision --autogenerate -m "add user setting tables"
 alembic upgrade head
For future changes to your models, repeat 2 up cmd, just update the '-m' comment

del the last script:
 alembic downgrade -1  
 # you need to rmv the file manually.